OL,3,AJohn Healey giving first major speech
OL,4,Aas chancellor
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust last week, UK borrowing costs rose
OL,7,Fagain, with interest rates on 10-year
OL,8,Fdebt reaching an 18-year high - this
OL,9,Fgraph shows the latest figures
OL,11,FHealey will deliver his first Budget on
OL,12,F28 October - which, he says, will be
OL,13,F"built on fiscal discipline"
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
