OL,3,AIsraeli strikes in southern Lebanese
OL,4,Avillage kill 11, state media say
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraeli air strikes on a village in
OL,7,Fsouthern Lebanon have killed at least
OL,8,F11 people, including two children,
OL,9,FLebanese state media say.
OL,11,FNine people were killed in one strike
OL,12,Fthat destroyed a three-storey
OL,13,Fresidential building in Kfar Rumman
OL,14,Fshortly after midnight, while two
OL,15,Fparamedics were killed in a second
OL,16,Fstrike on a car, according to the
OL,17,FNational News Agency.
OL,19,FThe Israeli military said it was
OL,20,Flooking into the reports.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
